Package: ECHO
Type: Package
Title: Exome Coverage and HMM Optimizer
Version: 0.1.0
Author: TL
Maintainer: TL <lavauxt@gmail.com>
Description: A modular R package for processing BAM files, extracting coverage, computing quality metrics, and calling/plotting CNVs using the ExomeDepthHMM algorithm. Supports BED preprocessing using curated RefSeq Select annotations, exon-level mapping, and VCF export.
